- IAM dual auth, users/roles, enterprise master data, customers/contracts
- Approvals engine + audit log API
- Guards/HR basics, operations (deployments/shifts/checkpoints); **Guards API** `GET/POST /guards` + `PATCH …/status` gated `operations.manage` — list enriched with phone/photoUrl/createdAt, linked employee `{employeeId,fullName}`, latest ACTIVE deployment + org site code/name; SUSPENDED/TERMINATED force `deploymentEligible: false`
